msgstr "Schema.org SpecialAnnouncement"

msgid "Adds Schema.org/SpecialAnnouncement to the JSON LD array. Creates SpecialAnnouncement."
msgstr "Schema.org/SpecialAnnouncement öğesini JSON LD dizisine ekler. SpecialAnnouncement öğesini oluşturur."

